OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785035891
OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham "has the
OL,7,Fcourage" to fix adult social care and
OL,8,Fwill make a start next week, a source
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FBurnham believes the issue of how
OL,12,Fadult social care works and is funded
OL,13,Fin England has been "neglected" by
OL,14,Fprevious administrations.
OL,16,FThe PM is also expected to make
OL,17,Finterventions on youth unemployment
OL,18,Fand devolution in the coming days.
OL,26,@nD@]OUoD@HO]uD@UOUuD@_O]
