OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785035891
OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,FA No 10 source said: "Andy is going to
OL,7,Frun towards problems that have been
OL,8,Fneglected, giving people hope again.
OL,10,F"He has the courage to fix the most
OL,11,Fdifficult issues that have been
OL,12,Fignored for years and seen as
OL,13,Fimpossible to resolve.
OL,15,F"He doesn't accept that they are. They
OL,16,Fcan't be ignored any longer. The Prime
OL,17,FMinister is determined to show that
OL,18,Fgovernments can make people's lives
OL,19,Fbetter if they choose to. He wants to
OL,20,Fget Britain believing again."
OL,26,@nD@VOUrD@AOUwD@AOU|D@]O]
