OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,FUnlike NHS care, social care is not
OL,7,Ffree at the point of use and high
OL,8,Fcosts sometimes mean people are forced
OL,9,Fto sell their homes to pay for what
OL,10,Fthey need.
OL,12,FPeople with savings worth more than
OL,13,F#23,250 are not entitled to help with
OL,14,Fthe cost of care from their local
OL,15,Fcouncil.
OL,17,FBurnham has already pledged to "use
OL,18,Fsome of my political capital" on the
OL,19,Fissue.
OL,26,@yD@`OUzD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
