OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785035891
OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,FIn 2019, in his first speech as prime
OL,7,Fminister, Boris Johnson said the
OL,8,FConservatives would "fix the crisis in
OL,9,Fsocial care once and for all",
OL,10,Fsomething that failed to come to
OL,11,Ffruition.
OL,13,FLabour, under Sir Keir Starmer, also
OL,14,Ffaced criticism in 2024 for scrapping
OL,15,Fplans for an #86,000 cap on the amount
OL,16,Fanyone in England would need to spend
OL,17,Fon their personal care over their
OL,18,Flifetime, having argued the proposals
OL,19,Fwere not "deliverable" in the time
OL,20,Fframe.
OL,26,@pD@UOUqD@]O]{D@JOU{D@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
