OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,FBurnham said the failure to act over
OL,7,Frecent decades was "not defensible".
OL,9,FThe prime minister and Chancellor John
OL,10,FHealey are already under pressure to
OL,11,Fsay how they will sustain a raft of
OL,12,Fsupport packages they announced for
OL,13,Fbus passengers, energy billpayers and
OL,14,Fpub punters.
OL,16,FThe Resolution Foundation has
OL,17,Festimated that this week's pledges
OL,18,Fwill cost a total of more than #2
OL,19,Fbillion in 2029/30.
OL,26,@oD@TOUoD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
