OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785035891
OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,F"It is all well and good for the Prime
OL,7,FMinister to promise to fix the issues
OL,8,Ffacing our country, but how is he
OL,9,Fgoing to pay for them? So far, he has
OL,10,Ffailed to convincingly explain how he
OL,11,Fwill pay for the policies he has
OL,12,Falready announced. We can only
OL,13,Fconclude that more tax rises are
OL,14,Fcoming down the track that families
OL,15,Fsimply cannot afford."
OL,17,FLiberal Democrat leader Sir Ed Davey
OL,18,Fsaid: "I really hope that this is the
OL,19,Fbeginning of a serious, lasting effort
OL,20,Fto end the social care catastrophe.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@VO]zD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
