OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785035891
OL,3,CBurnham to tackle 'neglected' issues
OL,4,Cof social care and youth unemployment
OL,6,F"Andy Burnham says he is willing to
OL,7,Fexpend political capital on this, and
OL,8,Fso am I.
OL,10,F"I will fight relentlessly to make
OL,11,Fsure family carers are not forgotten
OL,12,Fin this debate. They do the heavy
OL,13,Flifting in our society and deserve
OL,14,Fproper support.
OL,16,F"Fundamentally, we cannot fix this
OL,17,Fsystem without cross-party consensus.
OL,18,FI hope the prime minister's door will
OL,19,Fbe open so that we can finally get
OL,20,Fthis right together."
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU|D@UO]
